<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential on NAL.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential on NAL.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analysts Dean Eberling and Lauren Smith confirmed in a report that they started coverage of NAL Financial Group Inc with a buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Trading at 5.8 times our 1997 estimate of $1.50, this stock looks very cheap,&quot; they wrote.</p>
<p>-- The analysts said that NAL's earnings are &quot;poised to jump 50 percent in 1997 and 25-30 percent in 1998 as strategies gel.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/2 to 9-1/4.</p>
</text>
